  "decisions": {
    "retained": "Coaxial hollow-sleeve / independently rotating outer body topology. Working-band outer sleeve radius 8.85 mm used as 8.85 mm reference envelope plus 2 mm protective web, giving 10.85 mm aperture-start radius; bore minimum 4.49 mm used as nominal plain post radius.",
    "redesigned": "Three-lobed helical bore deliberately replaced by circular bearing for unrestricted radial-shutter rotation. No source thread mate is asserted or reused.",
    "sourceInterfaces": "Source bore about 4.49–6.85 mm radial and sleeve about 8.85 mm working outer radius. Complete original retention not established.",
    "newFits": "Proposed 0.30–0.70 mm radial and axial clearance, 2.1 mm glue socket with 4 mm plug engagement and 0.10–0.25 mm radial adhesive gap; not measured source tolerances.",
    "newMechanism": "Fixed 10–16 sector screen and one-more-slot rotor form traveling transmission lobes as the rotor turns. Three solid bed-flat parts; keeper must be bonded only to stationary hollow post.",
    "physicalPrintTested": false
  }
